food_prompt:
JSON format: {"dishes":[{"name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}

Examples:
Fried rice → {"dishes":[{"name":"fried rice","ingredients":[{"name":"cooked white rice","amount_g":200},{"name":"chicken","amount_g":120},{"name":"soy sauce","amount_g":20},{"name":"egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"sesame oil","amount_g":10}]}]}
Ramen → {"dishes":[{"name":"ramen","ingredients":[{"name":"ramen noodles","amount_g":200},{"name":"pork broth","amount_g":300},{"name":"chashu pork","amount_g":120},{"name":"soft-boiled egg","amount_g":50},{"name":"nori seaweed","amount_g":5}]}]}
Greek salad → {"dishes":[{"name":"greek salad","ingredients":[{"name":"frisee lettuce","amount_g":60},{"name":"feta cheese","amount_g":50},{"name":"cherry tomatoes","amount_g":40},{"name":"kalamata olives","amount_g":25},{"name":"olive oil","amount_g":15}]}]}

Look at this food photo. Identify each dish and list ingredients with gram estimates. Return only valid JSON.
Typical weights: rice/noodles ~200g, meat ~130g, broth ~300g, vegetables ~40g, oil ~15g.
